flowchart TB
    User["<img src='./docs/icons/microsoft-teams.svg' height='26'/> <img src='./docs/icons/microsoft-365-copilot.svg' height='26'/><br/>Teams / M365 Copilot"]

    %% Row 1 — two columns of bot identities
    BotP["<img src='./docs/icons/azure-bot-services.svg' height='28'/><br/><b>Production</b><br/>Azure Bot Service<br/>(Managed Identity)"]
    BotD["<img src='./docs/icons/azure-bot-services.svg' height='28'/><br/><b>Development / Debug</b><br/>Local Bot Service<br/>(single-tenant + secret)"]

    %% Transversal band spanning both columns (left ↔ right)
    APIM["&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;<img src='./docs/icons/azure-api-management.svg' height='28'/> &nbsp; <b>APIM</b> <br/> (validate-jwt policy) &nbsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;&emsp;"]

    %% Row 2 — two columns of compute
    AppP["<img src='./docs/icons/azure-app-services.svg' height='28'/><br/>Orchestrator Agent<br/>(App Service)"]
    Tunnel["<img src='./docs/icons/azure-dev-tunnels.svg' height='28'/><br/>Dev tunnel<br/>(public URL)"]
    Local["<img src='./docs/icons/computer.svg' height='28'/><br/>Local agent<br/>python main.py :3978"]

    %% Shared foundation
    Search["<img src='./docs/icons/azure-ai-search.svg' height='28'/><br/>AI Search<br/>(per-user ACLs)"]
    Foundry["<img src='./docs/icons/microsoft-foundry.svg' height='28'/><br/>Microsoft Foundry"]

    User <-->|"prompt / response"| BotP
    User <-->|"prompt / response"| BotD

    BotP <-->|"POST activity on /bot <br> (JWT) / reply"| APIM
    BotD <-->|"POST activity on /bot-local <br> (JWT) / reply"| APIM

    APIM <-->|"proxy /api/messages"| AppP
    APIM <-->|"proxy /api/messages"| Tunnel
    Tunnel <--> Local

    AppP <-->|"search + query / ACL docs"| Search
    AppP <--> Foundry
    Local <-->|"search + query / ACL docs"| Search
    Local <--> Foundry

